authors				Dave Gamble and cJSON contributors
status				testing

headline			Ultralightweight JSON parser in ANSI C
description
	cJSON is a small JSON parser and printer in one C file (C89), with cJSON_Utils for JSON Pointer, JSON Patch and JSON Merge Patch.  Usable from C and from C++ programs (libsyllable's GCC 4.1.2) alike, since it shares only the C ABI.
licenses			MIT

home				github.com/DaveGamble/cJSON
locations			https://github.com/DaveGamble/cJSON/archive/refs/tags/

; The CMake build (cmake/Ports.cmake) builds this port with patches/Makefile,
; which replaces the tarball's: that one builds with -Werror and warning flags
; GCC 4.1.2 doesn't know (-Wstrict-overflow) and -fstack-protector (no libssp
; on Syllable), and installs no static libraries.
make-file			Makefile

documentation		README.md LICENSE CHANGELOG.md
